{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "1fb6b31671c8118455c95f2258c6e2f4503cbb9402a794a8ddaf098cd17b6c04", "ja": "私たちの共通点", "zh": "我们的共同点", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "28e4c2b377c435d227945510ac830979d5cdb22090e0cf5f0cec84821b95f34a", "ja": "プロデューサーからの宿題で『はるみら』の\n感想を探すふたり。「似ている」という意見\nをたくさん見かけるが、本人はあまりピンと\n来ない。共通点を探した結果、それは『トッ\nプアイドルを目指している』事だと至る。", "zh": "两人接受制作人布置的作业，寻找对《春未来》的感想。经常看到“很相似”的意见，但本人却不太能理解。寻找共同点后，她们得出的结论是：两人都在以成为顶尖偶像为目标。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1000_null", "source_sha256": "de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481", "ja": "翌日……", "zh": "隔天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "ffe75adc07f062ecf4b6556fc352f5794746294518df312f2c23db66608d57ce", "ja": "おはようございます！\nミーティング、ここだって聞いて……あれ？", "zh": "早上好！\n听说会议是在这里……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "35d6d6e1e470990e78ac3e8ba6bd3f2d1df80c77ab229824aae3e26775c07203", "ja": "春香さんだけなんですか？\n{$P$}さんは？", "zh": "就只有春香小姐吗？\n{$P$}先生呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "5bcd535fc922909a35e9419d87c1f8ec7761b0ce1e1db4ad763a707aa80f7194", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、急用だって。\nそれでね……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生说有急事。\n所以呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "24bfa4db40abd95acb654ccdf6a660db333b778b13caaeb414b22e88cfeefe08", "ja": "到着するまで、私たちで先に話しておいて\nほしいことがあるって。宿題みたいなものかな。", "zh": "他说，在他到之前，想让我们先商量一件事。算是作业之类的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "1051df6c3ebeffa13b54d10c81b8088aa5c6b2f89290481393481eb2cabe3da0", "ja": "宿題……！？\nど、どんな感じのことですか……？", "zh": "作业……！？\n是、是什么样的事啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "ce25d4331619bb93924830c8b1ffd315b67f9611c833b4ff2f097ac02fc25eed", "ja": "そんなに怯えなくても大丈夫。\n未来ちゃんも、いつもやってるでしょ？", "zh": "不用那么害怕，没事的。\n未来不是也一直在做吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "08cca5f071b610b344c743e160c49e06abaf33824c5d6a7fbc1ba05ade6a6f84", "ja": "SNSで、『はるみら』の話題チェック！\nお茶でも飲みながら、一緒に見よう？", "zh": "在SNS上搜索关于“春未来”的话题！\n喝点茶，一起来看吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "d6e08e2215f0a792f1bbf4fe03ec4c23ccfc74a354ba7203e9f74b7ce428e3fd", "ja": "『はるみら』の……\nはい、わかりました！", "zh": "“春未来”的……\n好的，我知道了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "8b5a6b8dabba0952a7245e7b766513856e526db74745adcc6c73901b1f8bd249", "ja": "えへへ、今日もうれしい感想がいっぱい……♪\n私たちでこれなら、有名人の人は大変だなぁ……。", "zh": "嘿嘿，今天也收到了好多开心的感想……♪\n我们都这样了，那些大名人一定更辛苦吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "5a391096b256e147efb5514cc23f91ecb8f52cf47c28d8ddedb50b521140a699", "ja": "ふふっ、そうだね。有名な人は、\nきっと追いきれないんじゃないかなぁ。", "zh": "呵呵，是啊。知名人士的话，肯定会多到看不过来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "4a0b97d7af88518773afd9b73214c6ad6bd8ff0ee353dad11b8ce685f4242a76", "ja": "でも、どうしてなんでしょう？", "zh": "可是，为什么会这样呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "22096d6072081a48ce24aa3fa80fabc891c99def02f2fb9c65091d55f6f01332", "ja": "{$P$}さん、いつもは、\n「あんまり検索するな」って言うのに……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生平时明明总是说“别搜得太勤了”，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "964e17b1edff4aa8e527db5f0796e34b2517be309febb57b734d3084226849cb", "ja": "これは、私の予想だけど……\n答えを見つけてほしいのかもって。", "zh": "这只是我的猜测……\n或许是想让我们找到答案吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "a85a5e77810208989a32aa434f40bcb580ab40b090e09e07052ddfedec6da06d", "ja": "答え？", "zh": "答案？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "8fac518f639d7052a39403bfa03553fcb051cbcdba824dca13c7ed1f93f92fc2", "ja": "うん。『はるみら』は運よくプチバズが起きて、\nその勢いのまま来ちゃったけど……。", "zh": "嗯。“春未来”很幸运地小火了一把，\n虽然就顺着那个势头走到了现在……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1016_001har", "source_sha256": "4f77edb9ac63e1e3f869828305e2ecd455f2c806a158f449df53ee00fff0a988", "ja": "最初は『先輩と後輩』で組んで、あの番組でも、\n私たちなりの関係が言えないままだったでしょ？", "zh": "一开始是以『前辈和后辈』的关系搭档，在那个节目里，我们也没能说清楚彼此之间的关系吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1017_001har", "source_sha256": "39a1872b9949a77b8e5046aa1b678d99f7925c14747d9a413ec6919765391db0", "ja": "だから、私たちなりの答えが出せれば、\n今より一歩前に進めるかも？って。", "zh": "所以，要是能给出属于我们的答案，说不定就能比现在更进一步了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "9c0f9ed37318562e2199cbd94c53f0f2ce795bc5aa0f18d3f62f1caa166cd3a5", "ja": "今より一歩前に……そうですよね！\nよーし、たくさんの感想、チェックするぞ～！", "zh": "比现在再向前一步……确实如此！\n好——我要去看看大家的感想啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "4be6a6d50eea9a516947c7579cc443c98132dd807e3aebb3e49cb52d384d97fe", "ja": "私も！　えーと……「『はるみら』のふたりって、\n似てる気がする」「わかる」「雰囲気かな？」……。", "zh": "我也是！呃……“‘春未来’的两个人感觉很像”“我懂”“是气质吧？”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "c76b3d9dac36e769b14f13fa1e4ad35d5a7f3e55b6b8d75d091c12c9f6baf2d2", "ja": "似てる……私と春香さんが？\nあんまり言われたことないかも……。", "zh": "很像……我和春香小姐？\n好像没怎么被人这么说过……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1021_001har", "source_sha256": "bd6e2471922e376916670f01fa67957a83fc0d952011cd7b94b8e932001478a2", "ja": "私も意外だけど……。SNSだと、たまに\n似てるって言ってる人がいるのは見かけるね。", "zh": "我也觉得意外，不过……在社交平台上，偶尔能看到有人说我们很像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1022_001har", "source_sha256": "dd189a23f3bcdf50cfb1f8a29f04985e8a87ad055e589eec19c5f0f15b2846fe", "ja": "……よしっ！　私と未来ちゃん、\n似てるところがあるか、調べてみよう！", "zh": "……好！我和未来之间\n有没有相似的地方，来调查看看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1023_001har", "source_sha256": "36d8d67fb8d12a9be486ecc160c148f89cfb5c2af440bca0e7417cadf6585672", "ja": "えへへ、美咲さんから私たちのプロフィール表、\n借りてきちゃった。早速比べて見てみよう♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，我从美咲小姐那里把我们的个人资料表借来了。赶紧比较一下看看吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1024_001har", "source_sha256": "7ad827412407cdced619b026910a50e1642d1f07ad3e7b20c81956f19a1bfd22", "ja": "えーと、当たり前だけど、生年月日も年齢も\n違うよね……。あっ、血液型O型なんだ！", "zh": "嗯——，虽然是理所当然的，但出生日期和年龄都不一样呢……啊，原来是O型血！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1025_014mir", "source_sha256": "0c36071fc6d0bdb1e7d0148028f592a2c8713e12bd292a42fec6881845914769", "ja": "はい！　春香さんもですよね？\nあとは右利きも一緒で……。……。", "zh": "是的！春香前辈也是吧？\n还有，我们都是右撇子……。……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1026_014mir", "source_sha256": "dcae3d386b8c8115fc63b3585f142ea06cc53364a1ba639ae1050884dcd39a23", "ja": "……あれ、それぐらい？\nあんまり似てるとこないかも……。", "zh": "……咦，只有这些吗？\n好像没什么相似的地方……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1027_001har", "source_sha256": "7cb54ffc164c1ea702dc456c0ad5cd4832621e0f3ac42ea5e138760bfb0847dc", "ja": "そうだね……。", "zh": "是啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1028_014mir", "source_sha256": "3d7c25b27ec7d16406cca3b0cfd3b031a6a85b5be8a59224f4029e0bc81dfa3a", "ja": "あっ。私、『好きなもの』にライブってちゃんと\n書いてる！　これは今も変わりません♪", "zh": "啊。我在“喜欢的事物”那一栏里，\n好好写了演唱会呢！这点到现在也没变哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1029_001har", "source_sha256": "1495207f42db8654f0faf6c67cb650ee78d6f49788ffb94d22271ddf32a1f083", "ja": "私も『好きなもの』歌うことって書いたなぁ……。\nもしかして、似てるのかもだけど……", "zh": "我也写了“喜欢的东西”是唱歌呢……说不定，我们还挺像的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1030_001har", "source_sha256": "7e6872921d8aea82e7b4adb78e65140b4d01e1a47fe8d2834a9cddb6fbfceb69", "ja": "だって私たち、アイドルだもんね？", "zh": "因为我们可是偶像嘛，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1031_014mir", "source_sha256": "34a8343c4bcf3c59f3ead4993567700ff549dacea64835bd24b2629e31de917d", "ja": "はいっ！　……なんか、自分のプロフィール、\nすっごく久々に見た気がします。", "zh": "是！……总觉得，好久没看过自己的个人资料了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1032_014mir", "source_sha256": "3c8b82f2f6f94d89d57d036895b70c0feb4acf9871b84da38048b6508b3b5496", "ja": "更新したりするのかな……？　結構悩んじゃうから、\n書く欄が増えてないといいなぁ……。", "zh": "不知道要不要更新呢……？因为挺让人纠结的，\n希望填写的栏目没有增加才好……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1033_001har", "source_sha256": "69790f6f093bd75154fac981061766087c0289438d353bff05cdebf328c382ee", "ja": "うん。このプロフィールも、書き換える時が\n来るかもしれないね。……ねえ、未来ちゃん。", "zh": "嗯。说不定也会有需要改写这份个人资料的时候呢。……对了，未来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1034_001har", "source_sha256": "08174ae83d26a8faca995fe6706d3609d35d62627227644011800e26c1fb937e", "ja": "もし、プロフィールに『将来の夢』って\n項目があったら……なんて書く？", "zh": "如果个人资料里有“将来的梦想”这一栏……你会写什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1035_014mir", "source_sha256": "e1ea839a76618469c3fa3afd018ed36529e7689f9e9e19b0a3af71bcc0515adc", "ja": "『将来の夢』……。私は、すっごく、\nすっごいアイドルになりたいです！！", "zh": "“将来的的梦想”……我想成为超级、超级厉害的偶像！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1036_014mir", "source_sha256": "d69ed1cdf06282ff40e9c3d04a75a9e29904bf812aad7f4028bb09ee5cbed7c9", "ja": "何でもできちゃって、みんなが憧れて、\n大好きになっちゃうような！　春香さんは？", "zh": "什么都能做到，让大家憧憬、喜欢上的那种！春香前辈呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1037_001har", "source_sha256": "38bf5b83b45f84d5c76659e956403f2e0c82e5da280873f064a77941e9b694d7", "ja": "私も、最初はそんな感じ……ううん。今でもそう。", "zh": "我也是，一开始就是那种感觉……不对。现在也是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1038_001har", "source_sha256": "d9691ea5cb8b50e407b9f68fd1691a30c0695550e370f6851c39aef71db6bd1f", "ja": "すごいアイドルになりたい。みんなに、\nたくさんの人に、私を見てもらいたい。", "zh": "我想成为很厉害的偶像。想让大家，\n让许许多多的人看到我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1039_001har", "source_sha256": "b45602d25b99b68e081c1001d7decce6988e32f2355418414f8413d6c55d983f", "ja": "大好きな歌を歌って。\nそれから、笑顔を届けたい……。", "zh": "唱着最喜欢的歌。\n然后，把笑容传递给大家……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1040_014mir", "source_sha256": "27fd144fdb48d0dc2b0a2a70f54c30979be616bc23fd9d60dd6607b9007a62a0", "ja": "あ！！　そっか……見つけました！\n私たちの似てるとこ！", "zh": "啊！！对了……我找到了！\n我们相似的地方！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1041_014mir", "source_sha256": "afd479e5d796db1885441bb6831972b5d0807a5448ef262a8a35b55323d0be38", "ja": "私たち、ふたりとも\n『トップアイドルを目指してる』、です！", "zh": "我们两个人，\n都在『以顶级偶像为目标』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1042_001har", "source_sha256": "fe0b6ad498cccab4b1da68ed1e1a517e8e8740eff7927a9c9b44226d9baa5d68", "ja": "トップアイドル……。\nうん、そうだね。確かにそうかも……。", "zh": "顶级偶像……。\n嗯，说得对。确实是这样呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1043_001har", "source_sha256": "46a16137c10784af892e2170214174d2f43a256aeb6f11667a446197842aee97", "ja": "ううっ、悔しいな～！　言われてみれば、こんなに\nストレートな答え……私が先に言いたかった～！！", "zh": "呜呜，好不甘心啊～！被你这么一说，这么\n直接的回答……真想由我先说出来啊～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1044_014mir", "source_sha256": "08fffc561f7e02dc2d6a7b36f29513d0717fa0fe6e137c03944ea41ddd48c6ff", "ja": "えへへ……！　私だって、たまには\n春香さんより先に答えられるんですよ！", "zh": "嘿嘿……！我偶尔也能比春香小姐先答出来哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1045_001har", "source_sha256": "a6140fedb89151f62ea2e6207dc98e15a856b635afa9e3bb3b5012c739e60257", "ja": "やるな～、未来ちゃん……！\n私、負けられないって思っちゃった。ふふっ。", "zh": "真厉害啊～，未来……！\n我也觉得不能输给你了呢。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1046_014mir", "source_sha256": "8f2b76fc40adfcc8adb1336cc1297899997efc0d0053a486ac522f164c760940", "ja": "はい！　私も、負けませんからっ！！", "zh": "好的！我也不会输的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1047_001har", "source_sha256": "82124a97a26358f1d77a854fd9b2422eebff6f5945dd6973bfa10edf1b576281", "ja": "うん。\n……お互い、がんばろうね！", "zh": "嗯。\n……我们都要加油哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1048_014mir", "source_sha256": "87b770b9ef4e25a856f33f86c30f01c98be8e53492a00f35732cc370434b54da", "ja": "はいっ！　バラエティも、ライブも、\nいろんなお仕事がんばります！", "zh": "好的！综艺节目和演唱会，还有各种各样的工作，我都会努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1049_001har", "source_sha256": "6aa04ec232cbef79d7113118caa8853c5b531fa090c9cb757446d27a67116fcb", "ja": "ライブ……そうだ！　忘れてたけど、\nもうひとつ伝えることがあったんだ！", "zh": "演唱会……对了！虽然都忘了，但还有一件事要告诉你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1050_001har", "source_sha256": "8607a6eed03b89d7856049629fefe200880f9e4537d4ddd1c22e534dad48d684", "ja": "公演をするから希望を出してって、\n{$P$}さんから頼まれてて……。", "zh": "因为要举办公演，{$P$}先生让我提个希望来着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1051_014mir", "source_sha256": "135844eff47d6a648c51d39f55343aca9a723ef7bf93649741b7ea7ab83fe659", "ja": "公演？　……あっ、『はるみら公演』！？\nまだ、（仮）がついてるけど……！", "zh": "公演？……啊，《春未来公演》！？  \n虽然现在还挂着“（暂定）”……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_05_1052_001har", "source_sha256": "8205631f9e207391f26b046c64b7c2cdeb7d1149ef1331f2cddcf8b3d969b9a1", "ja": "そう。\n私たちふたりの曲だよ！", "zh": "对。是属于我们两个人的歌曲哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
